      "extract": "In this paper we introduce the notion of a spherical category. The moti- vation for this and the main application is to generalise the Turaev\u0015Viro state sum model invariant of a closed piecewise-linear 3-manifold. This application is discussed separately in [13]. A spherical category is defined to be a pivotal category which satisfies an extra condition, which states that two trace maps are equal. The universal",
