      "extract": "In this section we introduce spherical categories. A pivotal category is a category with duals and with some additional structure and a spherical category is a pivotal category in which the additional structure satisfies an extra condition. Strict pivotal categories are discussed in [3], where it is shown that the category of oriented planar graphs up to isotopy with labelled edges and with a distinguished edge at",
